Privacy Policy — Surya Namaskar: Tamil Guide

Effective date: 24 July 2026

Surya Namaskar: Tamil Guide is an offline wellness application published by KUHANATH.

Information we collect
The app does not collect, transmit, sell, or share personal information. It does not require an account and does not include advertising or analytics SDKs.
Information stored on your device
Your completed-session and round totals, recent practice dates, streak, language choice, in-progress practice position and its original settings, voice and vibration choices, and reminder preference are stored locally on your device. Android may include this information in its encrypted device backup if you have enabled Android backup. You can remove practice history using Reset progress in the app, or remove all information by clearing the app's storage or uninstalling it.

Notifications
If you enable the optional daily reminder, the app asks Android for notification permission. Your selected reminder time is scheduled locally on your device. No reminder information is sent to KUHANATH.

Text-to-speech
The app can use Android's installed text-to-speech service for Tamil or English pose guidance. How a selected text-to-speech engine processes speech is governed by that engine provider's privacy policy.

Children's privacy
The app is intended for a general audience and does not knowingly collect information from children.

Health information
The app provides general movement guidance and is not medical advice. It does not collect health information.

Changes
If this policy changes, the effective date above will be updated.

Contact
For privacy questions, contact: rselvaguru@gmail.com

